#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Input {#input}"
msgstr "Input {#input}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Both `SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` take one or more *primitive unified "
"blocs* (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains **one** "
"circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple "
"observables and parameters.  Each PUB returns a result.\n"
msgstr ""
"Parehong `SamplerV2` at `EstimatorV2` ay tumatanggap ng isa o higit pang "
"*primitive unified blocs* (PUBs) bilang input. Ang bawat PUB ay isang tuple "
"na naglalaman ng **isang** Circuit at ang data na ibino-broadcast sa Circuit"
" na iyon, na maaaring maraming observables at mga parameter. Bawat PUB ay "
"nagbabalik ng resulta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sampler V2 PUB format: (`<circuit>`, `<parameter values>`, `<shots>`), where"
" `<parameter values>`and `<shots>` are optional.\n"
msgstr ""
"Format ng Sampler V2 PUB: (`<circuit>`, `<parameter values>`, `<shots>`), "
"kung saan ang `<parameter values>` at `<shots>` ay opsyonal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* Estimator V2 PUB format: (`<circuit>`, `<observables>`, `<parameter values>`, `<precision>`), where `<parameter values>`and `<precision>` are optional.\n"
"    Numpy [broadcasting rules](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.broadcasting.html) are used when combining observables and parameter values.\n"
msgstr ""
"* Format ng Estimator V2 PUB: (`<circuit>`, `<observables>`, `<parameter values>`, `<precision>`), kung saan ang `<parameter values>` at `<precision>` ay opsyonal.\n"
"    Ginagamit ang Numpy [broadcasting rules](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/basics.broadcasting.html) kapag pinagsama ang mga observable at parameter value.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Additionally, the following changes have been made:\n"
msgstr "Bukod dito, ginawa rin ang mga sumusunod na pagbabago:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimator V2 has gained a `precision` argument in the `run()` method that "
"specifies the targeted precision of the expectation value estimates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Estimator V2 ay may bagong `precision` na argument sa `run()` na paraan "
"na tumutukoy sa target na precision ng mga estimate ng expectation value.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler V2 has the `shots` argument in its `run()` method.\n"
msgstr "Ang Sampler V2 ay may `shots` na argument sa `run()` na paraan nito.\n"

