"experiments-in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Estimator to determine the expectation values of multiple circuit-"
"observable pairs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang Estimator para alamin ang mga expectation value ng maraming "
"circuit-observable pair.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  <TabItem value=\"EstimatorV1\" label=\"Estimator (V1)\">\n"
